      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  50 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 1 Star in <em>Destructo Disk</em></li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A purple frisbee like attack that does less damage than the destructo disk but is much more controlled.</p>\n<p>Roll 2 <em>Omni Attack Rolls</em> each dealing 5d6 <em>Slashing Damage</em> on a hit, dealing double damage to structures and <em>Constructs</em>.</p>\n",
